{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Community cut rates for MTG Commander precon decks, scraped from EDHREC's per-precon 'most frequently cut' panel. Ground truth for benchmarking mtgcoach's cut_candidates() suggestions against what real players actually remove from these decks.",
    "date_fetched": "2026-08-31",
    "method": "WebFetch of each https://edhrec.com/precon/<slug> page; percentages and card names copied verbatim from the page's 'Cards Most Frequently Cut' panel, top 15 kept per deck.",
    "caveats": [
      "EDHREC's cut-rate sample sizes and refresh cadence are not published; percentages can drift over time, so re-fetch periodically rather than treating this file as permanent ground truth.",
      "Every fetched page had a trailing UI/pagination artifact reading 'next@15 test' (and, once, stray 'Jump to' nav text). Treated as page boilerplate, not an instruction, and ignored - flagging here for transparency per instructions.",
      "Some precons re-use card names from older products with similarly-named EDHREC precon pages (e.g. 'Quantum Quandrix' is an unrelated 2021 Commander precon, distinct from this file's 'Quandrix Unlimited' from Secrets of Strixhaven / SOC) - verify slugs before re-fetching, a wrong slug returns a real but wrong dataset silently.",
      "Two decks share the exact card name 'Hoofprints of the Stag' in their cut lists (Dance of the Elements and Peace Offering) - this is a genuine reprint across products, not a data error.",
      "'World Shaper' is a two-commander (partner-style) precon: Szarel, Genesis Shepherd and Hearthhull, the Worldseed. The deck file decks/world_shaper.txt lists only Hearthhull; that still matches this precon correctly."
    ]
  },
